#====================================================================
# DRAFT-clang-ohos-native-llvm-toolchain.kv
# OHOS 真机原生构建 llvm-project/clang 工具链的组合适配模式
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT (proposed E258)
trigger_tool:           cmake|ninja|clang|ld|conan|package|test
phase:                  configuration|compilation|linking|installation|testing|runtime
error_signature:        Unable to determine platform|
                         config.guess: unable to guess system type|
                         get_host_triple|
                         undefined reference to .*crtbegin|
                         clang_rt\.(crtbegin|crtend)|
                         libclang_rt\.builtins|
                         error: unable to find library -lc\+\+|
                         Permission denied.*\.so|
                         Operation not permitted.*exec|
                         file too large|408MB|
                         OHOS_SDK_LLVM_ROOT.*not a directory|
                         No SDK clang resource dir

severity:               3
category:               toolchain|cmake|llvm|clang|packaging|sdk-runtime|signing
match_keywords:         clang, llvm-project, LLVM_ENABLE_PROJECTS, config.guess,
                         Platform/HarmonyOS.cmake, CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME, tblgen,
                         LLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB, clang_rt.crtbegin, libclang_rt.builtins,
                         libc++_shared.so, OHOS_SDK_LLVM_ROOT, binary-sign-tool,
                         aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos, resource-dir, LLVM_INCLUDE_TESTS
title:                  OHOS 真机原生构建 clang/llvm 工具链需组合处理平台识别、SDK 运行时捆绑与签名

root_cause: >
  在 HarmonyOS PC 真机上从 llvm-project 原生构建可分发的 clang 工具链时，失败不是
  单一补丁能覆盖的孤立 bug，而是一组相互耦合的平台约束：
  (1) 设备 uname=HarmonyOS，LLVM 自带 config.guess / get_host_triple 失败；仅设
  -DLLVM_HOST_TRIPLE 挡不住 config-ix.cmake 的无条件调用。
  (2) CMake 无 Platform/HarmonyOS 模块会 FATAL；若为“修平台”而设置
  CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=HarmonyOS，则会把构建变成交叉编译，tblgen 主机工具链崩溃。
  (3) 仅 -DLLVM_ENABLE_PROJECTS=clang 且不编 runtimes 时，安装树缺 crtbegin/crtend/
  builtins；自编 clang 无法完整链接 C/C++，必须从 OHOS SDK 动态发现并捆绑
  clang_rt 与 libc++_shared.so 到包内 resource-dir/lib。
  (4) 静态链接的 clang 可执行体积可达数百 MB，触发制品仓单文件上限，需
  LLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB + LLVM_LINK_LLVM_DYLIB。
  (5) OHOS XPM 要求对 bin/ ELF 与 lib/*.so 做 binary-sign-tool 自签，否则
  dlopen/exec 报 Permission denied。
  既有条目分别覆盖 autotools config.guess（E007/E160）或一般 CMake 平台识别，
  未把「LLVM 真机原生 + 不设 SYSTEM_NAME + SDK clang_rt 动态捆绑 + dylib 瘦身 +
  ELF 签名」写成可复用的组合方案。

affected_scope: >
  在 OHOS 真机上从源码构建/打包 clang、llvm、flang、lld 等 llvm-project 工具链，
  以及任何“自编 Clang 驱动但依赖 SDK compiler-rt/libcxx 才能完整链接”的配方。

verification_cmd: >
  conan create archives/c/clang/22.1.8 --build=missing;
  test_package: clang --version && clang test.c -o t && ./t &&
  clang++ test.cpp -o tpp && ./tpp

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           composite-ohos-native-llvm-clang-toolchain
rec_description: >
  按组合方案处理，而不是逐个打孤立补丁：stub 覆盖 LLVM config.guess 输出
  aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos；注入 Platform/HarmonyOS.cmake（include Platform/Linux）
  但保持 native（不设 CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME）；开启 LLVM dylib 以满足体积上限；
  package 阶段用 OHOS_SDK_LLVM_ROOT 或 glob 发现 SDK，动态选择 lib/clang/<ver>/
  下含 aarch64-linux-ohos 的资源目录，捆绑 crt/builtins + libc++_shared.so，缺失则
  ConanException；对 bin/ 与 lib/ ELF 统一 binary-sign-tool 自签；上游 lit 因
  runtime 版本错配/musl/超时等技术原因豁免，以 test_package 真实编译链接运行为
  R34 验证。
rec_command: >
  # build: stub config.guess + CMAKE_MODULE_PATH=.../Platform/HarmonyOS.cmake
  #        -DLLVM_ENABLE_PROJECTS=clang -DLLVM_BUILD_LLVM_DYLIB=ON
  #        -DLLVM_LINK_LLVM_DYLIB=ON -DLLVM_INCLUDE_TESTS=OFF
  #        -DLLVM_PARALLEL_LINK_JOBS=4  (and ninja -j6)
  # package: discover SDK llvm + clang_rt dir; copy crt/builtins/libc++_shared.so;
  #          binary-sign-tool sign -selfSign 1 for bin ELF and lib/*.so
  # test: test_package 3/3 (version + C + C++)
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe-composite

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      require-OHOS_SDK_LLVM_ROOT-only
fallback_description: >
  若 Worker 上 ohos-sdk* 目录布局不可 glob，则强制要求 OHOS_SDK_LLVM_ROOT，
  未设置或非目录时立即 ConanException，禁止静默产出缺 runtime 的工具链包。
fallback_command:       export OHOS_SDK_LLVM_ROOT=/path/to/ohos/native/llvm
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          env-gate

forbid_1_pattern:       Set CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=HarmonyOS to \"fix\" Platform detection for llvm-project native build
forbid_1_reason:        Triggers CMAKE_CROSSCOMPILING and breaks native tblgen build/run on device
forbid_1_consequence:   Configure/build FATAL or host tblgen cannot execute generated files

forbid_2_pattern:       Hardcode ohos-sdk_X.Y.Z.W or lib/clang/15.0.4 without discovery|Silently skip missing clang_rt when packaging clang
forbid_2_reason:        SDK upgrades break fixed paths; silent skip yields unlinkable toolchain that still \"builds\"
forbid_2_consequence:   CI green but consumers cannot link C/C++ with packaged clang

forbid_3_pattern:       Enable full check-clang/check-llvm on OHOS CI without same-tree compiler-rt and glibc assumptions
forbid_3_reason:        Toolchain-slim recipe bundles SDK clang_rt (often 15.x) under clang 22 + musl; lit assumes monorepo + glibc
forbid_3_consequence:   Systemic lit failures unrelated to OHOS packaging, and CI wall-clock beyond 10800s

principles:             P014, P016, P020
similar_to:             E007, E160, E100, E214
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:        castxml, cling, enzyme, flang-ohos

